---
import MarketingLayout from "../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
---

<MarketingLayout
  title="Connect with Valkey · Valkey"
  description="Ways to connect with the Valkey community: GitHub, Matrix, Slack, social media, security reports, and the Code of Conduct."
>
  <PageHeader title="Connect with Valkey" />

  <div class="width-limiter">
    <article class="prose narrow-prose">
      <p>You can connect with Valkey in many ways.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          If you have a <strong>question</strong> about Valkey, head over to the project{" "}
          <a href="https://github.com/orgs/valkey-io/discussions">GitHub discussions</a> or{" "}
          <a href="https://matrix.to/#/#valkey:matrix.org">Matrix chat</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          If you've found a <strong>bug</strong> in Valkey, file a bug issue on{" "}
          <a href="https://github.com/valkey-io/valkey/issues/new?assignees=&labels=&projects=&template=bug_report.md&title=%5BBUG%5D">valkey-io/valkey</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          If you want to suggest a <strong>new feature</strong> for Valkey, file a feature request issue on{" "}
          <a href="https://github.com/valkey-io/valkey/issues/new?assignees=&labels=&projects=&template=feature_request.md&title=%5BNEW%5D">valkey/valkey-io</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          If you are interested in becoming a <strong>contributor</strong>, you can connect with other developers on our{" "}
          <a href="https://valkey.io/slack">slack</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          You can connect on the following <strong>social media</strong> platforms:
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/valkey/">Valkey on LinkedIn</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://twitter.com/valkey_io">Valkey on Twitter</a></li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          If you need to report a potential <strong>security issue</strong> with Valkey, see the{" "}
          <a href="https://github.com/valkey-io/valkey/blob/unstable/SECURITY.md">Security Policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          If you need to report an issue with a community member's behavior, see the{" "}
          <strong><a href="/code_of_conduct/">Code of Conduct</a></strong>.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </div>
</MarketingLayout>

<style>
  .narrow-prose {
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
</style>
